{
  "@context": {
    "schema": "https://schema.org/"
  },
  "@type": "Note",
  "@id": "note:notion-77",
  "title": "Brand Overview (1)",
  "author": "person:jane-brew:001",
  "status": "draft",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b-1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Brand Overview (1)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Faires Sekiya’s brand is deeply rooted in **legacy, craftsmanship, and emotional storytelling**—with a rich blend of old-world artistic influence and modern cinematic precision. Given the insights from their brand development form, we can design a **portfolio that visually and experientially embodies their philosophy**, translating the principles of *Painting with Light* into UI/UX."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-3",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Portfolio Concept: \"Midnight Light\"**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "A digital experience that feels **like stepping into a lush, midnight-blue library**—warm, moody, cinematic. This portfolio should **pull the viewer in slowly, much like a well-paced film or a Phil Collins song**, then deliver **a striking energy shift** that mirrors their dynamic approach to storytelling."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-6",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**1. Mood & Atmosphere: A Digital \"Library of Light\"**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-11",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-7",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Color Palette:** Midnight blue dominates, contrasted with deep blacks, warm golden highlights, and soft gradients."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-8",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Lighting Effect:** Soft glows around interactive elements, subtle spotlight animations, and cinematic transitions."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-9",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Typography:** A mix of **classic serif fonts** (reflecting timeless craftsmanship) with **modern sans-serif** for clarity and contrast."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-10",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Texture & Depth:** A blend of **smooth, polished UI with organic elements** like subtle paper or canvas textures, paying homage to the tactile experience of sculpting and painting."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-12",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "🎨 **Metaphor:** The UI should **feel like a scene lit with precision**, with dark shadows and strategic highlights, just as in *film noir* or a masterful chiaroscuro painting."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-13",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**2. Layout & Interaction: Cinematic Flow**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-14",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "💡 **Guiding Principle:** Just as cinematographers control framing and pacing, the portfolio should **lead the audience through an immersive visual narrative.**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-15",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Homepage: \"The Slow Pull-In\"**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-19",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-16",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**A full-screen video background** that fades from darkness into a **single, strikingly lit frame**—perhaps the cinematographer at work, or a reel playing in the background."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-17",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Scrolling triggers a gradual reveal**, mimicking a slow dolly shot."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-18",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Typography enters like film credits**, with subtle fade-ins or letter-by-letter animation."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-20",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Portfolio Showcase: \"The Spotlight Effect\"**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-24",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-21",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Each project is displayed like a **film reel or storyboard grid**, but on hover or click, the image **brightens as if illuminated by a spotlight**."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-22",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Video thumbnails should play in **slow-motion previews**, reinforcing the immersive cinematic feel."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-23",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "A **before/after lighting toggle** (optional): Allowing users to see the **raw vs. final lit frame**, demonstrating the artist’s touch."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-25",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**About Page: \"The Personal Backstory\"**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-27",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-26",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Instead of a standard bio, the page **unfolds like a screenplay** with acts and scenes:"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-28",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Act 1:** The grandfather’s book (*Painting with Light*)."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-29",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Act 2:** Early struggles and inspirations."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-30",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Act 3:** Breakthrough moments, such as working with Michael Keaton."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-31",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Contact Page: \"An Invitation to Collaborate\"**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-34",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-32",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "A **direct, no-nonsense call to action**, framed like the **title card of a classic film**:*\"Let’s Tell Stories. Let’s Paint with Light.\"*"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-33",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "A simple, elegant **form with a spotlight hovering effect**, guiding the user’s focus."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-35",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**3. Motion & Interaction Design: Cinematic Pacing**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-36",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "💡 **Guiding Principle:** Like a great film edit, interactions should be **deliberate, smooth, and emotionally engaging.**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-41",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-37",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Page Transitions:** A **slow fade-in from black** on load, mimicking the opening of a film."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-38",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Hover Effects:** Icons and text **light up like marquee signs** when hovered."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-39",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Click Feedback:** Clicking on a project **triggers a subtle film-reel flicker** before transitioning."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-40",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Parallax & Depth:** Background elements move subtly, adding a **3D depth akin to a tracking shot**."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-42",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**4. Unique Features: \"Signature Moments\"**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-43",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**📽️ \"The Reel in the Dark\"**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-44",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "A hidden **dark mode reel** where users can only \"light up\" frames by interacting—symbolizing how a cinematographer brings a scene to life with light."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-45",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**🎼 \"Soundtrack Integration\"**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-46",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "A soft, **interactive music layer**, allowing users to experience a **playlist curated by the cinematographer** (Phil Collins, Motown, Coordinator) for an immersive touch."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-47",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**📜 \"A Tribute to the Masters\"**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-48",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "A section dedicated to **Michelangelo, Leonardo, Robert Richardson, and Chris Seager**, showcasing how their influence is woven into his work."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-49",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-50",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "This cinematographer’s brand isn’t just about work samples—it’s about **an ethos, a philosophy, and an emotional connection to light and storytelling**. The website should feel **like stepping into a cinematic universe**—one carefully crafted, lit with intention, and designed to immerse."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-51",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Would you like me to create a wireframe or visual mockup based on these ideas? 🚀"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}